# Recipe for script/gather/skinning-enhanced.razor. Build it with: python3 util/build-scripts.py
# Every setting of the loop is under #@ config, grouped by the module that reads it.
# The blocks are files in module/, run in the order listed under #@ blocks.
#@ output script/gather/skinning-enhanced.razor

#@ header
# Dungeon Two-Handed Axe melee with Magery self support, combat potions, sword codex control and corpse skinning.
# Needs: a Two-Handed Axe, a skinning knife, codices of swords and parrying, bandages, potions and reagents.
# Optional: the loadout looting pouch.
# Template: Forensic Evaluation 120, Swordsmanship 100, Tactics 100, Magery, Resisting Spells, Parrying, Anatomy, Healing 80.
# Optional cooldown bars: heal pot, walk, reflect. A missing bar reads 0 and cannot hold a cast back.
# Melee stays manual (Z then V). The script never attacks and never picks a target.
# Magery is for recovery and PK readiness: Smart Heal/Cure, Greater Heal, Reactive Armor and Magic Reflection.
# Warmode is toggled by hand (Tab). Recovery, buffs and skinning ignore it. Meet a PK with combat/pvp (F4).
# The knife is used from the backpack, so the axe stays equipped. Leather is looted by hand from the opened corpse.
# Design notes and in-game checks: blueprint/open-items.html part 11.

#@ blocks
# Before the loop.
#@ use core/start                    clears the client queues
#@ use core/pvp-stop                 stops inside structured PvP, here and at the top of every pass
# Every pass, in this order.
#@ use gather/combat-target          remembers the enemy picked with lasttarget
#@ use core/paralyze                 trapped pouch while held
#@ use core/cure                     cure potion, else the Cure agent
#@ use core/heal                     heal potion, else Greater Heal at the emergency line
#@ use core/bandage                  self bandage
#@ use core/light-heal               light Heal, the bandage stand-in
#@ use core/refresh                  Refresh at low stamina
#@ use gather/axe                    re-arms the Two-Handed Axe
#@ use gather/gold                   drops gold while over weight
#@ use core/stat-potions             Strength, Agility and Magic Resist while an enemy is remembered
#@ use gather/sword-codex            Warrior, Defensive while hurt, and the finisher
#@ use gather/parry-codex            Bulwark, Warding against damage over time, and the finisher
#@ use gather/weapon-ability         Chop on the enemy within 2 tiles
#@ use core/self-buffs               Reactive Armor, then Magic Reflection
#@ use gather/skinning               carves corpses between fights
#@ use core/reagents                 reagent flags, read after the carve replies so it cannot consume them
#@ use gather/food                   eats from a tray
#@ use gather/leather                moves leather into the loot pouch
#@ use core/pass-wait                end of the pass

#@ config
# ---- core/output -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional script overheads. Essential warnings remain visible.
@setvar! config__chatty 1
# Journal diagnostics. Each block that writes one says so in its own comments.
@setvar! config__sysmsg 1

# ---- core/switches -----------------------------------------------------------------
# Independent features. No option overrides another.
@setvar! config__use_magery 1
@setvar! config__use_potions 1
@setvar! config__use_bandages 1
# 1 makes our own casts wait while the walk bar runs, so a step does not break them.
# 0 casts while walking, for a fight where there is no better moment to wait for.
@setvar! config__walk_guard 1
# 1 when warmode is the player's manual control window: our own casts stand down while it is on.
@setvar! config__warmode_is_manual 0

# ---- core/cure ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Minimum current mana for the Cure agent.
@setvar! config__mana_cure 6

# ---- core/heal ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Missing hit points, not percent.
#   heal_hits       heal potion
#   emergency_hits  Greater Heal when no heal potion can go out. Not below heal_hits
@setvar! config__heal_hits 35
# This loop: Bandages handle ordinary damage, so Greater Heal waits for 45.
# heal_hits also holds carving, buffs and leather packing back.
@setvar! config__emergency_hits 45
# Minimum current mana for Greater Heal. It keeps no reserve: raise it to 31 to always leave
# 20 mana for an attack or Teleport.
@setvar! config__mana_greater_heal 11

# ---- core/bandage ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Healing must be above this to bandage. 0 means any Healing at all.
# This loop: Healing 80 template. Below 10 the light Heal stands in.
@setvar! config__heal_skill_min 10

# ---- core/light-heal ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Light Heal beside the bandages. With no bandage able to run (use_bandages 0, no Healing, or
# none left) it goes anyway, as the bandage stand-in. Needs use_magery.
@setvar! config__use_light_heal 0
# Missing hit points that start the light Heal, and its minimum current mana.
@setvar! config__light_hits 15
@setvar! config__mana_heal 4

# ---- core/refresh ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Current stamina at or below this drinks a Refresh.
# This loop: DEX 80 gives about 80 stamina. Refresh at 60.
@setvar! config__refresh_stam 60

# ---- gather/axe --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Re-arm the axe when the left hand is empty. 5187 is the two handed axe in blueprint/item-list.html.
@setvar! config__use_weapon 1
@setvar! config__weapon_graphic 5187

# ---- gather/gold -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Over max weight, drop this much gold at your feet per pass. Gold is cheaper than the leather.
@setvar! config__use_gold_drop 1
@setvar! config__gold_drop_amount 2000

# ---- core/stat-potions -------------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! config__use_stat_potions 1
@setvar! config__use_resist_potion 1
# STR and DEX with the Greater potion on: your base plus 20. Below these the potion is drunk.
# Bless and the Strength and Agility spells, ours or an ally's, show the same icons as the
# potions but add less than its 20, so the stat is what tells the potion apart.
# This loop: STR 100 and DEX 80 template.
@setvar! config__str_potion 120
@setvar! config__dex_potion 100

# ---- gather/sword-codex ------------------------------------------------------------
# Codex of swords. The slot numbers follow the codex list order on the wiki.
@setvar! config__use_sword_codex 1
@setvar! config__sword_stance_aggressive 1
@setvar! config__sword_stance_defensive 2
@setvar! config__sword_stance_cleave 3
@setvar! config__sword_stance_warrior 4
@setvar! config__sword_stance_flaying 5
# Stance held outside the Defensive window. Cleave pays only against two or more enemies.
@setvar! config__sword_stance_main config__sword_stance_warrior

# Finisher slot to keep selected. 0 leaves the codex finisher alone.
@setvar! config__sword_finisher_bleed_out 1
@setvar! config__sword_finisher_execute 2
@setvar! config__sword_finisher_main config__sword_finisher_execute

# Defensive latches on above the enter line and only releases below the leave line, so the
# stance cannot flap while bandages tick. Both are hit deficit, not percent.
@setvar! config__defensive_enter_diff 60
@setvar! config__defensive_leave_diff 48

# ---- gather/parry-codex ------------------------------------------------------------
# Codex of parrying, see PARRY CODEX. Slot numbers follow the wiki list order.
# A stance only helps with ranks in it. Pick ranked ones.
@setvar! config__use_parry_codex 1
@setvar! config__parry_stance_shield_bash 1
@setvar! config__parry_stance_warding 2
@setvar! config__parry_stance_testudo 3
@setvar! config__parry_stance_mirror 4
@setvar! config__parry_stance_bulwark 5
# Bulwark while Testudo's ranks are low. Switch to config__parry_stance_testudo once they catch up.
@setvar! config__parry_stance_main config__parry_stance_bulwark
# Stance while poisoned, bleeding or diseased.
@setvar! config__parry_stance_dot config__parry_stance_warding
# 0 keeps the main stance while the remembered enemy is within 2 tiles. 1 switches there too.
@setvar! config__parry_dot_in_melee 0
# Parry finisher slot to keep selected. 0 leaves it alone.
@setvar! config__parry_finisher_last_stand 1
@setvar! config__parry_finisher_barrier 2
@setvar! config__parry_finisher_main config__parry_finisher_last_stand

# ---- gather/weapon-ability ---------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! config__use_weapon_ability 1
@setvar! config__ability_spinslash 1
@setvar! config__ability_rend 2
@setvar! config__ability_chop 3
@setvar! config__ability_main config__ability_chop

# ---- core/self-buffs ---------------------------------------------------------------
@setvar! config__use_reactive_armor 1
@setvar! config__use_magic_reflect 1
# Minimum current mana to start each buff.
# This loop: Buffs keep the lumberjack handbook's 20 mana for Greater Heal and Teleport against a PK.
@setvar! config__mana_reactive_armor 24
@setvar! config__mana_magic_reflect 34
# Missing hit points at which buffs are not started, and cut mid cast.
@setvar! config__buff_max_loss 35
# 0 keeps buffs back while poisoned and cuts one that is casting.
# This loop: The cure goes first: no buffs while poisoned.
@setvar! config__buff_when_poisoned 0

# ---- gather/skinning ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Skinning. 1 carves every creature corpse within 2 tiles, grey or not, by targeting each corpse.
# Player remains are never targeted. 0 carves grey corpses only, through Smart Harvest on self.
# Where the server refuses the first as a criminal action, grey corpses only for 5 minutes.
@setvar! config__use_skinning 1
@setvar! config__skin_unowned 1

# ---- gather/leather ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Move carried leather into the looting pouch selected by loadout.
@setvar! config__pack_leather 1

#@ setup
if config__pack_leather = 1
    if not varexist global__my_looting_pouch or not find global__my_looting_pouch backpack
        overhead "[ loot pouch, pick ]" 255
        setvar global__my_looting_pouch
    endif
endif

# loot/recycle runs the hotkey named in this list when it finishes or gives up. A list, because
# a variable cannot hold a word (blueprint/razor.html part 3). It lasts until the client closes.
if not listexists 'list__resume_script'
    createlist 'list__resume_script'
endif
clearlist 'list__resume_script'
pushlist 'list__resume_script' 'Play Script: gather\skinning-enhanced'

if config__sysmsg = 1
    sysmsg "Skinning enhanced v11 loaded: skin unowned={{config__skin_unowned}}, sword stance={{config__sword_stance_main}}, parry stance={{config__parry_stance_main}}." 88
endif
if config__chatty = 1
    overhead "[ skinning, on ]" 290
endif
